1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:01,846
(Bernadette:)What are you looking at?

2
00:00:02,057 --> 00:00:04,357
(Howard:)Pictures of my dad and me
when I was a kid.

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,080
- That's nice.
- I gotta tell you...

4
00:00:06,262 --> 00:00:08,922
(Howard:)...as angry as I am at Sheldon for blabbing...

5
00:00:09,098 --> 00:00:13,088
...he did a hell of ajob
organizing this closet.

6
00:00:13,836 --> 00:00:14,856
(Howard:)Look at this.

7
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:19,300
"Photos of Wolowitz Family
Before Father Left Forever."

8
00:00:21,443 --> 00:00:25,643
Look. Check out 9-year-old Howie
with cornrows.

9
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:30,940
(Howard:)Neither race was happy
to see me with those.

10
00:00:34,456 --> 00:00:35,716
Think you can take a break?

11
00:00:35,891 --> 00:00:38,191
- Why?
- Got a little surprise for you.

12
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,730
(Howard:)Come on.

13
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:42,792
(Howard:)Oh, honey...

14
00:00:42,965 --> 00:00:45,955
(Howard:)...I am in no mood to have sex tonight.

15
00:00:47,469 --> 00:00:50,909
I mean, I'll lay there
if you absolutely have to have it, but...

16
00:00:51,073 --> 00:00:52,093
(Penny:)Oh.

17
00:00:53,742 --> 00:00:55,642
(Howard:)What are you guys doing here?

18
00:00:55,811 --> 00:00:59,301
You weren't sure whether you wanted
to know what was in your dad's letter...

